---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<PageLayout eyebrow="Transparency" title="Affiliate & advertising disclosure" description="How this site earns money, and how that does and doesn't affect what we publish.">
  <p>{SITE.name} is free to read. To keep it that way, we may earn money in the following ways:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Affiliate links.</strong> Some links to accommodation, tours or activities are affiliate links. If you book through one, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Articles that contain affiliate links are marked at the top.</li>
    <li><strong>Digital products.</strong> We sell our own planners and templates.</li>
    <li><strong>Display advertising.</strong> Some pages may show ads from advertising networks.</li>
    <li><strong>Sponsored content.</strong> Paid partnerships are always clearly labeled "Sponsored".</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Our editorial rule</h2>
  <p>We recommend things because they're useful to readers, not because they pay. Commissions never decide which hotel, tour or route we suggest, and we'll tell you when a cheaper or better option exists outside our partner links.</p>
  <h2>Prices</h2>
  <p>Prices quoted in guides were accurate on the date shown in each article. Fares and availability change often, so always confirm with the provider before booking.</p>
</PageLayout>
